{"page":159,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:68","surah":7,"ayah":68,"ar_uthmani":"أُبَلِّغُكُمْ رِسَـٰلَـٰتِ رَبِّى وَأَنَا۠ لَكُمْ نَاصِحٌ أَمِينٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"I am delivering my Lord’s messages to you. I am your sincere and honest adviser.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أُبَلِّغُكُمْ","en_gloss":"I convey to you","transliteration":"uballighukum","verse_key":"7:68"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رِسَـٰلَـٰتِ","en_gloss":"Messages","transliteration":"risālāti","verse_key":"7:68"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَبِّى","en_gloss":"(of) my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"7:68"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَأَنَا۠","en_gloss":"and I am","transliteration":"wa-anā","verse_key":"7:68"},{"pos":5,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"7:68"},{"pos":6,"ar":"نَاصِحٌ","en_gloss":"an adviser ","transliteration":"nāṣiḥun","verse_key":"7:68"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَمِينٌ","en_gloss":"trustworthy","transliteration":"amīnun","verse_key":"7:68"},{"pos":8,"ar":"٦٨","en_gloss":"(68)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:68"}]},{"verse_key":"7:69","surah":7,"ayah":69,"ar_uthmani":"أَوَعَجِبْتُمْ أَن جَآءَكُمْ ذِكْرٌ مِّن رَّبِّكُمْ عَلَىٰ رَجُلٍ مِّنكُمْ لِيُنذِرَكُمْ ۚ وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟ إِذْ جَعَلَكُمْ خُلَفَآءَ مِنۢ بَعْدِ قَوْمِ نُوحٍ وَزَادَكُمْ فِى ٱلْخَلْقِ بَصْۜطَةً ۖ فَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟ ءَالَآءَ ٱللَّهِ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُفْلِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do you find it so strange that a message should come from your Lord, through a man in your midst, to warn you? Remember how He made you heirs after Noah’s people, and increased your stature: remember God’s bounties, so that you may prosper.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَوَعَجِبْتُمْ","en_gloss":"Do you wonder","transliteration":"awaʿajib'tum","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَآءَكُمْ","en_gloss":"has come to you","transliteration":"jāakum","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ذِكْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a reminder","transliteration":"dhik'run","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":6,"ar":"رَّبِّكُمْ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbikum","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":8,"ar":"رَجُلٍۢ","en_gloss":"a man","transliteration":"rajulin","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لِيُنذِرَكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"that he may warn you","transliteration":"liyundhirakum","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"And remember","transliteration":"wa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":13,"ar":"جَعَلَكُمْ","en_gloss":"He made you","transliteration":"jaʿalakum","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خُلَفَآءَ","en_gloss":"successors","transliteration":"khulafāa","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":17,"ar":"قَوْمِ","en_gloss":"(the) people","transliteration":"qawmi","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":18,"ar":"نُوحٍۢ","en_gloss":"(of) Nuh","transliteration":"nūḥin","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَزَادَكُمْ","en_gloss":"and increased you","transliteration":"wazādakum","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱلْخَلْقِ","en_gloss":"the stature","transliteration":"l-khalqi","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":22,"ar":"بَصْۜطَةًۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"extensively","transliteration":"baṣ'ṭatan","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":23,"ar":"فَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"So remember","transliteration":"fa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ءَالَآءَ","en_gloss":"(the) Bounties","transliteration":"ālāa","verse_key":"7:69"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","translite